            <title>[LU-20549] qmt_pool_recalc problem for LQA</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20549</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Reading the code I found potential problem needs to be fixed. qmt_pool_recalc called for LQA would go through it's own hash with one lqe. In qmt_site_recalc_cb it may call qmt_pool_lqes_lookup_spec and there qid == 1. It would go through the pool list and add lqes with enforced qid = 1. It is definitely not correct. Probably, for lqa lqe we could skip this part.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I don't think it is a critical issue. But some day this should be fixed.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
